asset-sprite-source-readonly = Read only. Import writes a picture and a sprite animation next to this file. Each clip has one speed, kept to three decimal places. When frame durations share a step, frames are repeated to match; otherwise the speed is the average duration. A duration of 0 counts as 100 ms, or the file default when it has one. Ping-pong plays forward then back. Extra tag repeats are dropped. Slices stay in this list: a sprite animation has no named cells.
